  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s pure dream clone shatters his aperture and undergoes immortal ascension. The complete Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique is the eleventh extreme physique and holds an immense amount of human qi. After the tribulation, the three qi fuse, he tosses his vital dream butterfly mortal Gu into the lump, and an immortal aperture forms. The blessed land is super grade, the standard of a ten extreme physique. He refines dream butterfly Immortal Gu to rank six. After the tribulation he bows to the main body and says that from today onwards, his name is Meng Qiu Zhen. Fang Yuan calls it a good name and asks to see the dream path blessed land. That aperture has 8000 km2 of land, a time rate of forty-six times, and an origin core that produces fifty-five green grape immortal essence each year. Fang Yuan treats it as the best location he has to nurture dream path immortal material.",
      "chapters": [
        2090
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique",
        "gu_dream_butterfly_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a head full of long pink hair that looks dreamy and illusory. His shining gaze is extremely captivating, and his facial contours are smooth.",
      "chapters": [
        2256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yu Zi calls him peerlessly beautiful.",
      "chapters": [
        2257
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He explores a dream realm that originated from Spectral Soul, using dream butterfly Immortal Gu from his immortal aperture, with dream armor Immortal Gu and dream creation Immortal Gu as further methods. Dream path master attainment gives him instincts for the correct answers. When instincts fail, dream butterfly Immortal Gu lets him foresee dream realm possibilities. Even though he only has rank six cultivation level, his efficiency at exploring dream realms is many times that of Fang Yuan’s main body.",
      "chapters": [
        2095
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-exploration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dream_armor_gu",
        "gu_dream_creation_gu",
        "path_dream"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yu Zi greets him as Lord Meng Qiu Zhen. He has a head full of long pink hair that looks dreamy and illusory, a shining captivating gaze, and smooth facial contours. Although he is only at rank six, being shown concern by him makes Yu Zi feel a sense of security. He says he personally set up the formation around the earth vein node, restrains the abnormal dao marks on her with a dream path method, and repairs that formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-vein-node",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
